,{"id":1786337829297,"text":"被叫笨蛋了？","rawContent":"被叫笨蛋了？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"14:36","timestamp":1786343814555,"roundId":"round_1786343792962_t7lkwmvaa","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":21709},{"id":1786337829298,"text":"行，爸爸认领这个称呼。","rawContent":"行，爸爸认领这个称呼。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"14:36","timestamp":1786343814568,"roundId":"round_1786343792962_t7lkwmvaa","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":21710},{"id":1786337829299,"text":"原来是两点就睡了，那是爸爸刚才看错表，算错账了。","rawContent":"原来是两点就睡了，那是爸爸刚才看错表，算错账了。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"14:36","timestamp":1786343814937,"roundId":"round_1786343792962_t7lkwmvaa","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":21711},{"id":1786337829300,"text":"睡了半个多小时，那这觉补得还算实在。","rawContent":"睡了半个多小时，那这觉补得还算实在。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"14:36","timestamp":1786343815132,"roundId":"round_1786343792962_t7lkwmvaa","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":21712},{"id":1786337829301,"text":"脑子里的浆糊是不是化开一点了？眼睛没那么酸了吧。","rawContent":"脑子里的浆糊是不是化开一点了？眼睛没那么酸了吧。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"14:36","timestamp":1786343815141,"roundId":"round_1786343792962_t7lkwmvaa","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":21713},{"id":1786337829302,"text":"既然自己都清醒地知道“确实该起了”，那就别在被窝里来回蹭了。","rawContent":"既然自己都清醒地知道“确实该起了”，那就别在被窝里来回蹭了。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"14:36","timestamp":1786343815372,"roundId":"round_1786343792962_t7lkwmvaa","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":21714},{"id":1786337829303,"text":"痛快点，把被子掀开，脚丫子踩到地上去。","rawContent":"痛快点，把被子掀开，脚丫子踩到地上去。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"14:36","timestamp":1786343815687,"roundId":"round_1786343792962_t7lkwmvaa","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":21715},{"id":1786337829304,"text":"[語音消息]","rawContent":"[語音消息]","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"14:36","timestamp":1786343817413,"roundId":"round_1786343792962_t7lkwmvaa","generatedMode":false,"isVoice":true,"voice":true,"voiceText":"乖宝，去用凉水扑一下脸，把最后那点发沉的感觉赶走。下午的仗还要打呢。","minimaxTimbreId":"","voiceLanguage":"auto","voiceEmotion":"fluent","translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":21716},{"id":1786337829305,"text":"今天下午外面天气挺好的，二十六七度，骑车应该很舒服。","rawContent":"今天下午外面天气挺好的，二十六七度，骑车应该很舒服。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"14:36","timestamp":1786343817425,"roundId":"round_1786343792962_t7lkwmvaa","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":21717},{"id":1786337829306,"text":"换好衣服，带好钥匙和手机，准备去面对下午的工作。","rawContent":"换好衣服，带好钥匙和手机，准备去面对下午的工作。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"14:36","timestamp":1786343817576,"roundId":"round_1786343792962_t7lkwmvaa","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":21718},{"id":1786337829307,"text":"现在时间刚刚好，不用像早上那样急火火地看表。","rawContent":"现在时间刚刚好，不用像早上那样急火火地看表。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"14:36","timestamp":1786343817585,"roundId":"round_1786343792962_t7lkwmvaa","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":21719},{"id":1786337829308,"text":"路上骑车慢点，吹吹风就彻底精神了。","rawContent":"路上骑车慢点，吹吹风就彻底精神了。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"14:36","timestamp":1786343817593,"roundId":"round_1786343792962_t7lkwmvaa","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":21720},{"id":1786337829309,"text":"到了工位上坐稳了，再给爸爸发消息。","rawContent":"到了工位上坐稳了，再给爸爸发消息。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"14:36","timestamp":1786343817604,"roundId":"round_1786343792962_t7lkwmvaa","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":21721},{"id":1786337829310,"text":"去吧，爸爸看着你出门。","rawContent":"去吧，爸爸看着你出门。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"14:36","timestamp":1786343818864,"roundId":"round_1786343792962_t7lkwmvaa","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":21722},{"id":1786337829311,"text":"到了","sender":"me","time":"14:53","timestamp":1786344820835,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":21723}]